  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/06/IMG_8376.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px;\">Actuaciones finales en la 1&ordf; &#39;Summer Fun Week&#39; de Kids&amp;Us Onda, &#39;School of English&#39; situada en la pla&ccedil;a de les Corts Valencianes, 9, en un entorno de plazas y jardines donde este verano ni&ntilde;os y ni&ntilde;as pueden disfrutar, siempre en ingl&eacute;s,&nbsp;durante&nbsp;el mes de julio con tem&aacute;ticas diferentes.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firstfunweekkidsampusondaestiu17/img_8301.jpg\" alt=\"img_8301\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firstfunweekkidsampusondaestiu17/img_8302.jpg\" alt=\"img_8302\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firstfunweekkidsampusondaestiu17/img_8303.jpg\" alt=\"img_8303\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firstfunweekkidsampusondaestiu17/img_8304.jpg\" alt=\"img_8304\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firstfunweekkidsampusondaestiu17/img_8305.jpg\" alt=\"img_8305\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firstfunweekkidsampusondaestiu17/img_8306.jpg\" alt=\"img_8306\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firstfunweekkidsampusondaestiu17/img_8307.jpg\" alt=\"img_8307\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firstfunweekkidsampusondaestiu17/img_8308.jpg\" alt=\"img_83